code,core,ui: detach long-running commands via lofi.job_* and /job

lofi.bash blocked the agent loop until the wrapped command exited, so
any build, test sweep, or watched server held the chat hostage. Spawn
commands into a session-scoped registry instead, surface their status
through a /job modal, and signal completion through a new transient
Notice prompt so the user sees the result without it being conflated
with their own typing; the distinction survives session reload.